# GCH-OBJ:   {{^    L[0-9]+: }}call valuetype [msil.bcl]System.Runtime.InteropServices.GCHandle(object) [msil.bcl]System.Runtime.InteropServices.GCHandle::'Alloc'{{$}}
# GCH-IMAGE: {{^    L[0-9]+: }}call valuetype [mscorlib]System.Runtime.InteropServices.GCHandle(object) [mscorlib]System.Runtime.InteropServices.GCHandle::'Alloc'{{$}}
# TM8: {{^}}msil-ld: error: managed call '[[F]]': '[[V]]' is a value type, which msil-ld checks only against references; pass --reference=<reference assemblies>{{$}}
# TM8TAB-NEXT: {{^}}msil-ld: error: .NET member '[[T]]' is not in msil-ld's built-in mscorlib table; pass --reference=<reference assemblies>{{$}}

