# TM16: {{^}}msil-ld: error: managed call '[[F]]': '[[T]]' is a [[K]] type, but the declaration uses it as a [[U]] type{{$}}
# UNDEF: {{^}}msil-ld: error: undefined .NET member '[[M]]' (requested by [[O]]); 'Contoso.Widget' is defined in FakeWidgets 1.0.0.0 [null] (refs{{[/\\]}}FakeWidgets.dll) but has no such member; overloads present: {{.+$}}

## MK3's parents: a TypeSpec in the object, the TypeRef in the image; the
## plain spelling of a value type's static members links.
# RUN: llc -filetype=obj -mtriple=x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-msil pt-static.ll -o pt-static.o
# RUN: llvm-cil-dump pt-static.o | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=PT-OBJ
# RUN: msil-ld pt-static.o --reference=refs -o pt-static.exe 2>&1 | count 0
# RUN: llvm-cil-dump pt-static.exe | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=PT-IMAGE
