## MK2's stub shape: an access in none of the three shapes.
# RUN: llc -filetype=obj -mtriple=x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-msil shape.ll -o shape.o
# RUN: %python patch-access.py shape.o bad-shape.o
# RUN: not msil-ld bad-shape.o --reference=refs -o x.exe 2>&1 | %{err} --check-prefix=SHAPE
# RUN: not ls x.exe
# SHAPE: {{^}}msil-ld: error: bad-shape.o: managed call 'point_sum': the stub calls 'Contoso.Point::Sum' through 'constrained. System.Runtime.InteropServices.GCHandle', but 'System.Runtime.InteropServices.GCHandle' has no such member; the object needs a matching toolchain{{$}}

